{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Dangers lurking everywhere</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seemingly peaceful and beautiful natural scenery may be ambushed by brutal alien creatures. Animals with cute appearance may have been infected and may suddenly attack when approached. You need to be ready with weapons to repel them at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/70112b166c7f572df71d097082ed8785.poster.avif?t=1752466421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/70112b166c7f572df71d097082ed8785.webm?t=1752466421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/70112b166c7f572df71d097082ed8785.mp4?t=1752466421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Strengthen skills</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources during exploration and adventure. Once you have enough resources, you can synthesize weapons on the crafting table. Each weapon has different characteristics and skills. Whether in single-player or multiplayer mode, you can experience a full sense of freshness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/7be75f7e6b73509cacdfb582413bdbc0.poster.avif?t=1752466421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/7be75f7e6b73509cacdfb582413bdbc0.webm?t=1752466421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/7be75f7e6b73509cacdfb582413bdbc0.mp4?t=1752466421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Biotechnology</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat powerful monsters to obtain their DNA information, unlock powerful biotechnology, and transform into various animals and giant monsters, and unlock special skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/d8125489489ed831e9b2306a2c80595e.poster.avif?t=1752466421\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/d8125489489ed831e9b2306a2c80595e.webm?t=1752466421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/d8125489489ed831e9b2306a2c80595e.mp4?t=1752466421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Friendly interaction</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various skills to help each other with good friends, such as using the transformation skill to turn your friends into cats to escape the monster's pursuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/b7ea8edd1152cdd46d2e52aa3497ae00.poster.avif?t=1752466421\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/b7ea8edd1152cdd46d2e52aa3497ae00.webm?t=1752466421\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/b7ea8edd1152cdd46d2e52aa3497ae00.mp4?t=1752466421\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pig King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3633400/ef4e90b8652cb1de78488a8e5d319f19b62c2579.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633400?t=1752466421","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633400?t=1752466421","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/ce595375ac763a02cce86f42e986782adf66f3e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752466421","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/ce595375ac763a02cce86f42e986782adf66f3e1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752466421","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3651390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Dangers lurking everywhere</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seemingly peaceful and beautiful natural scenery may be ambushed by brutal alien creatures. Animals with cute appearance may have been infected and may suddenly attack when approached. You need to be ready with weapons to repel them at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/70112b166c7f572df71d097082ed8785.poster.avif?t=1752466421\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633400/extras/70112b166c7f572df71d097082ed8785.webm?t=17